Shadow21 is a modified version of AnonSurf by the Parrot Security team and contributors.
Upstream debian/copyright declares GPL-3.0-or-later for the application; LICENSE is retained as shipped and LICENSE-GPL-3 contains the GPL-3 text.
Original source: https://gitlab.com/parrotsec/packages/anonsurf
