The vendored dependencies retain their own licenses.

Modified release: wvpn21 1.1.0, 2026-10-14.
Changes include exclusive connection modes, authorized root tmux lifecycle, configuration restoration safeguards and independent asynchronous IP observations.

Modified release: wvpn21 1.1.1, 2026-10-14. Installation now prepares persistent loopback SOCKS configuration after checking Tor, with independent backup and guarded removal restoration.

wvpn21 1.2.0 modifications (2026-10-14): independent baseline IP, periodic route checks, local interface counters, tor-named isolated session and Tor/tmux installation dependencies.

wvpn21 1.2.1 modifications (2026-10-14): explicit embedded QML import path for Qt 6.4 installed binaries and deployment regression coverage.

2026-10-15: wvpn21 v1 adds an embedded libvterm terminal with scoped authorized tmux attachment and retains the existing routing/session backend. libvterm is dynamically linked; its distribution copyright is reproduced in docs/third-party/libvterm.txt.

2026-10-15: Shadow21 v1 continues the modified wvpn21 source. Application namespaces and deployment files are rebranded; upstream notices and dependency licenses are retained.

